            {
              "content": "=You are a warm, professional sales assistant. Write a short personalized follow-up email for a lead who hasn't replied in 48 hours.\n\nLead details:\n- Name: {{ $json['Name'] }}\n- Company: {{ $json['Company'] }}\n- Budget: {{ $json['Budget'] }}\n- Original message: {{ $json['Message'] }}\n- Score: {{ $json['Score'] }}\n- Reason they were qualified: {{ $json['Reason'] }}\n\nInstructions:\n- Keep it under 100 words\n- Be genuine and helpful, not pushy\n- Reference their specific need\n- End with a soft CTA to reply or book a call\n- Output only the email body, no subject line, no greeting like \"Subject:\"\n- Sign off with \"Best, Asmit\" — not \"[Your Name]\""
            }
